    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Missing end-to-end handoff",
      "items": [
        "No code passes segmentation predictions into the prescription-map generator.",
        "Path-planning experiments do not read the generated map files; the controller does not read route output.",
        "DeepLab/U-Net definitions are unconnected: active cell 21 calls custom() from absent models.i_model; old_model is imported but its Unet construction is commented out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Split and artifact distinctions",
      "items": [
        "Notebook cell 5 writes split_data/train.txt and test.txt from list_of_images.txt. Dataset cell 20 instead reads train_et.txt/test_et.txt created by cell 18; this ET pair is missing here.",
        "The map notebook writes outputs/*.png from synthetic circles. Root loss.png and crop6GT.png are separate artifacts with unverified run provenance.",
        "Stored notebook outputs and images do not prove this checkout reruns successfully."
      ]
    }
